it. You will not regret it.", "timestamp_created": 1719770467, "timestamp_updated": 1719770467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168622358", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057615339", "personaname": "Samerty7", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/samerty7/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2883, "last_played": 1734890304, "avatar": "7c3990e5acb719159cfd8d332bf8785b482d3861"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a stellar fast-paced, high intensity, shooter, if this genre is of interest to you I would recommend purchasing this game as the nothing has captured the joy and pleasure of traversing around the levels and obliterating your opponents. I should also mention before going on this title is a Rougelite expecting you to replay the game several times to unlock more abilities and make subsequent runs easier. I personally loved the gameplay loop but it might not be for everyone.\nTo provide a more in-depth description of this game, it feels like a blend between Borderlands and Doom. Specifically, the combat of Doom with the co-op, weapon variety, and exploration of Borderlands. There are numerous secrets and several different unique paths that you can take to get to the final level. Coupled with a cast of 6 total playable robots each boasting their own unique perks and this game will keep you busy for while.\nI can not recommend this game enough to anyone who like or is interested in FPS games with an arcadesq flair to them.", "timestamp_created": 1719769166, "timestamp_updated": 1719769166, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}